<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lend Lease half yr net rises 14.2 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lend Lease half yr net rises 14.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    188.7 vs 157.7</p>
<p>    Net				     160.0 vs 140.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     48.0 vs 43.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Lend Lease Corp Ltd is a property, financial services and construction group.  </p>
<p>    Sales				   874.3 vs 661.5</p>
<p>    Other income			  159.3 vs 121.6</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    64.5 vs 60.3</p>
